{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS1G3zSMvB2dGj7UUxfD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens, sent through `Analytics.capture` with the exact names from the spec. `dart format` and `flutter analyze` report no issues, but there are no tests and I didn't run the app. `ANSWER.md` has the full write-up.\n\n**Fewer events than raw callbacks.** You're on the PostHog free tier, and several Flutter callbacks fire much more often than the action they stand for:\n- **Email / phone started:** sent once per visit, the first time each field has text. Otherwise every keystroke would send one.\n- **Loan amount:** sent when a slider drag or tap ends (`onChangeEnd`), not on every frame of the drag.\n- **Terms accepted:** sent only when the box is ticked, not when it's unticked.\n- **Offers scrolled:** sent when a scroll gesture ends, and only if the user got further down than the last event on that visit. So `offset` is the furthest point reached, and scrolling back up sends nothing. To track that, I changed `OfferScreen` from a `StatelessWidget` to a `StatefulWidget`.\n\n**Personal data:** no email or phone number goes into any event.\n\n**Things to know:**\n- `registration_continue_tapped.terms` will always be `true`. The Continue button is disabled until terms are accepted, so nothing else is possible. I kept it because the spec lists it.\n- Package download (`pub get`) didn't complete here, so the analyzer ran with its default checks only, without your `flutter_lints` rules.\n- Running the Flutter tools edited `analysis_options.yaml` and created `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`. I reverted all of that, so the only changes are in the two screen files plus `ANSWER.md`.\n\nNothing was committed or sent to any outside service."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_read_input_tokens":29814,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ed6bb4d-93e3-4c2a-8414-375120adb656","uuid":"07b481bb-45db-49f6-af54-bd47c3aadc47","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:08:14.908Z","request_id":"req_011CgS1G3jpA3QQLg6KmLwf1"}
